WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.260 --> 01:38.940
=Episode 37=

02:44.020 --> 02:44.860
What brings you here?

02:58.300 --> 02:58.780
Chunhua.

03:00.980 --> 03:01.980
I'll protect you.

03:03.580 --> 03:04.300
This time,

03:06.820 --> 03:07.940
if we can get through this,

03:10.420 --> 03:13.140
no one will ever trample on us again.

03:14.620 --> 03:15.100
Wenji.

03:16.340 --> 03:17.100
What's happened?

03:26.980 --> 03:27.380
Wenji.

03:27.980 --> 03:28.900
I'm a little scared.

03:32.260 --> 03:33.700
Is it about the Princess?

03:34.540 --> 03:35.220
What's happened to her?

03:42.100 --> 03:43.180
It has nothing to do with her.

03:44.620 --> 03:45.460
With the famine,

03:46.300 --> 03:47.460
some refugees have stirred up trouble.

03:50.740 --> 03:51.300
Really?

03:52.780 --> 03:54.140
Then why did you look so frightened?

03:59.860 --> 04:00.620
Did I

04:03.540 --> 04:04.340
look frightened just now?

04:19.620 --> 04:20.220
You imagined it.

04:21.980 --> 04:22.740
I'm just exhausted.

04:25.340 --> 04:26.940
I've spent all day on the coronation.

04:31.420 --> 04:32.300
What coronation?

04:33.220 --> 04:33.700
Tomorrow,

04:34.980 --> 04:36.620
Prince of Jin will
become the new emperor.

04:39.980 --> 04:40.820
Him? The Emperor?

04:45.620 --> 04:46.140
That doesn't matter.

04:47.740 --> 04:48.620
What matters is

04:54.700 --> 04:56.020
what you'll become,

04:57.860 --> 04:59.660
and what I'll become.

05:02.500 --> 05:03.100
Tomorrow,

05:07.140 --> 05:08.300
you can move into the palace.

05:15.860 --> 05:17.980
Then we can see each other often.

05:29.100 --> 05:29.780
Someone!

05:38.740 --> 05:39.100
Your Majesty.

05:42.620 --> 05:43.700
Why is there ceremonial

05:44.740 --> 05:45.140
music?

05:48.940 --> 05:49.300
Your Majesty.

05:50.220 --> 05:51.580
It's the coronation music.

05:52.260 --> 05:53.020
Coronation?

05:56.900 --> 05:58.220
The Crown Prince has taken the throne?

05:59.580 --> 06:01.580
I never issued such a decree.

06:02.820 --> 06:04.420
Didn't you order me

06:04.980 --> 06:06.500
to deliver the decree for approval?

06:07.620 --> 06:08.220
And now,

06:09.140 --> 06:10.220
Prince of Jin has ascended the throne.

06:12.020 --> 06:12.900
Prince of Jin?

06:14.980 --> 06:16.340
Why him?

06:21.340 --> 06:21.900
You...

06:22.340 --> 06:22.780
You...

06:23.460 --> 06:24.380
It was you!

06:26.500 --> 06:26.980
You...

06:27.820 --> 06:28.500
It was you!

06:29.140 --> 06:29.500
You...

06:32.340 --> 06:34.300
How dare you!

06:35.820 --> 06:36.780
Your Majesty, you're confused.

06:39.980 --> 06:40.940
The decree

06:41.900 --> 06:44.020
clearly named Prince of Jin.

06:45.860 --> 06:46.340
Your Majesty.

06:46.500 --> 06:47.060
Guards!

06:47.580 --> 06:49.380
- Please look after your health.
- Chancellor Liu...

06:49.620 --> 06:50.660
Where is Chancellor Liu?

06:51.460 --> 06:51.780
Wanyao!

06:51.780 --> 06:52.220
Your Majesty,

06:52.860 --> 06:53.980
it's time for your calming tonic.

06:54.580 --> 06:55.140
I won't drink it!

06:55.540 --> 06:56.980
I won't! Guards!

06:57.300 --> 06:57.700
Guards!

06:57.780 --> 06:58.620
No! I won't drink it!

07:30.660 --> 07:31.220
Thanks.

07:36.380 --> 07:37.100
What's going on?

07:37.420 --> 07:38.620
Why all the secrecy?

07:39.020 --> 07:39.700
Listen to me.

07:40.340 --> 07:41.580
I just came from the east.

07:42.020 --> 07:42.740
Take my advice.

07:43.100 --> 07:45.100
Don't head east. It's dangerous.

07:45.300 --> 07:46.740
The Shence Army went east.

07:47.300 --> 07:48.220
War's coming.

07:48.700 --> 07:49.580
Impossible.

07:50.060 --> 07:50.860
If that were true,

07:51.060 --> 07:52.220
we're so close to Tongguan.

07:52.780 --> 07:54.300
How could we have heard nothing?

07:54.860 --> 07:56.940
Well, maybe there's nothing they can do.

07:58.780 --> 07:59.300
True enough.

08:00.140 --> 08:01.780
They say our new emperor

08:02.060 --> 08:03.260
isn't very bright.

08:04.020 --> 08:04.860
You can say that again.

08:04.860 --> 08:05.660
Come on, let's eat.

08:05.780 --> 08:06.060
Dig in.

08:06.460 --> 08:07.140
Excuse me, gentlemen.

08:07.940 --> 08:09.660
When did we get a new emperor?

08:11.540 --> 08:12.540
You're a woman.

08:12.820 --> 08:14.060
It's only natural you wouldn't know

08:14.060 --> 08:14.980
about affairs of state.

08:15.900 --> 08:16.780
Then please tell me,

08:17.620 --> 08:18.900
which prince took the throne?

08:19.100 --> 08:20.340
Of course I know that.

08:20.780 --> 08:21.340
It's...

08:22.500 --> 08:23.220
the Prince of Jin.

08:24.300 --> 08:25.580
Come on, let's get back to our food.

08:25.900 --> 08:26.300
Eat up.

08:35.140 --> 08:38.260
(Jifang Pavilion)

08:49.700 --> 08:50.660
Why did you stop?

08:51.540 --> 08:52.260
Keep fighting!

08:52.580 --> 08:55.140
(Xun)

09:01.100 --> 09:02.100
March straight on Tongguan!

09:04.100 --> 09:04.580
Your Majesty,

09:05.060 --> 09:06.340
here are the latest military reports,

09:06.540 --> 09:07.580
and memorials from the prefectures.

09:08.940 --> 09:09.300
Put them down.

09:10.620 --> 09:11.140
No, no.

09:11.700 --> 09:12.140
Not here.

09:13.220 --> 09:13.700
Take them to the imperial study.

09:21.740 --> 09:22.700
This is where we are.

09:23.380 --> 09:24.340
This is Tongguan.

09:25.500 --> 09:26.220
And this is Sheng'an.

09:30.420 --> 09:31.460
If Prince of Jin has become emperor,

09:31.980 --> 09:33.380
he won't be able to stop the rebels.

09:35.500 --> 09:36.580
But why him?

09:37.700 --> 09:38.620
And why so suddenly?

09:39.100 --> 09:40.180
No one even sent word to me.

09:41.700 --> 09:42.900
What is Chancellor Liu doing?

09:47.620 --> 09:48.660
When we get back to Sheng'an,

09:49.260 --> 09:50.220
we'll find out the truth.

09:55.860 --> 09:56.820
Who would have thought

09:57.500 --> 09:58.380
a princess's hands

09:58.860 --> 10:00.060
could grow so calloused?

10:03.220 --> 10:05.340
Those are from reviewing memorials.

10:06.220 --> 10:08.620
These are from practicing swordplay.

10:19.420 --> 10:20.340
Keep up!

10:23.620 --> 10:25.140
Don't stop! Keep moving!

10:25.660 --> 10:26.420
Over here! This way!

10:26.540 --> 10:27.500
Quick! Be careful!

10:27.700 --> 10:28.460
Watch yourselves!

10:28.460 --> 10:28.980
Let's take a look.

10:32.020 --> 10:33.700
Mother, I'm scared!

10:35.060 --> 10:36.460
Hurry! Hurry!

10:37.700 --> 10:38.860
Sir, where are you going?

10:40.500 --> 10:40.820
Come on!

10:42.580 --> 10:43.060
Sir!

10:44.180 --> 10:45.220
What's happened?

10:45.980 --> 10:47.700
Young lady, you again?

10:48.140 --> 10:49.100
Go home, quickly!

10:49.540 --> 10:50.140
Behind us,

10:50.340 --> 10:52.180
many soldiers have fought their way
over there!

10:52.700 --> 10:54.180
I heard Tongguan has fallen!

10:54.580 --> 10:55.380
I can't stay and talk!

11:12.900 --> 11:13.340
Your Highness,

11:13.980 --> 11:14.940
Sheng'an needs you.

11:19.420 --> 11:20.140
There's no time.

11:21.340 --> 11:22.020
Tongguan has fallen.

11:22.580 --> 11:23.260
Sheng'an is in chaos.

11:24.860 --> 11:27.020
The rebels have seized the key pass.

11:28.180 --> 11:29.220
Sheng'an's current defenses

11:29.700 --> 11:30.620
can't hold them off.

11:34.140 --> 11:34.700
Yan Shang,

11:36.940 --> 11:38.220
I can't return to Sheng'an with you.

12:10.820 --> 12:15.180
♪I ride through endless sands
without rest♪

12:16.180 --> 12:22.580
♪Frost stains my sleeves;
The setting sun lights towers♪

12:22.660 --> 12:28.020
♪Wild geese fly south
through late autumn♪

12:28.300 --> 12:33.660
♪May the endless wind linger for me♪

12:36.020 --> 12:36.540
(Yan Shang.)

12:37.540 --> 12:38.420
(Who knows if we'll)

12:39.820 --> 12:40.980
(live to meet again)

12:42.060 --> 12:43.500
(in this lifetime after this parting.)

12:44.700 --> 12:45.900
(I'll wait for you in Sheng'an)

12:48.300 --> 12:49.100
(to come home.)

12:49.900 --> 12:54.220
♪Whose eyes have seen
the smoke of war?♪

12:54.260 --> 12:57.500
♪I'll ride into battle♪

12:57.580 --> 13:01.580
♪Blood stains my sleeves as I
stand firm. Never will I fall behind♪

13:02.140 --> 13:06.380
♪I bow beyond the frontier walls♪

13:06.660 --> 13:11.440
♪May you live a life free of sorrow;
May the moon shine on us forever♪

13:11.440 --> 13:16.660
♪May you live a life free of sorrow;
May the moon shine on us forever♪

13:19.300 --> 13:19.780
Yan Shang,

13:21.100 --> 13:21.740
this time,

13:23.020 --> 13:24.340
let me tell you a story.

13:24.740 --> 13:25.100
All right.

13:25.540 --> 13:25.940
I'm listening.

13:26.860 --> 13:29.860
Once there was wood and iron.

13:31.100 --> 13:32.700
The wood was made into a boat.

13:33.540 --> 13:35.900
Men carried the iron aboard the boat.

13:37.140 --> 13:38.420
They had nothing in common,

13:38.980 --> 13:39.940
(Relay Station)
yet they felt like old friends at once.

13:40.020 --> 13:40.300
Sir!

13:40.900 --> 13:41.740
Both were

13:42.580 --> 13:43.260
filled with joy.

13:43.260 --> 13:43.740
Bring a new horse.

13:43.740 --> 13:46.500
♪So many clever schemes
with a fan's wave♪

13:46.500 --> 13:47.700
When the boat unloaded at the shore,

13:48.260 --> 13:49.260
they parted ways.

13:50.900 --> 13:51.460
Later,

13:52.780 --> 13:54.100
the iron was forged into a spear,

13:54.700 --> 13:56.020
which broke on the battlefield.

13:56.900 --> 13:58.220
The wooden boat met a storm

13:59.220 --> 14:00.380
and shattered against the rocks.

14:02.540 --> 14:04.780
The broken spear became a hairpin.

14:06.300 --> 14:07.300
And the wrecked boat's wood

14:08.260 --> 14:09.700
was carved into a comb.

14:10.660 --> 14:11.420
(Relay Station)
Here's the horse.

14:12.700 --> 14:14.340
They met again in a beauty's hair.

14:14.540 --> 14:15.340
All right. Thank you.

14:15.460 --> 14:16.500
And they were amazed to find

14:17.460 --> 14:19.020
how much they had both changed.

14:22.020 --> 14:22.660
Before long,

14:23.860 --> 14:24.820
the beauty grew old,

14:26.060 --> 14:26.980
and her household fell into decline.

14:26.980 --> 14:28.580
♪I'll ride into battle♪

14:28.820 --> 14:29.980
They were separated again.

14:29.980 --> 14:32.660
♪Blood stains my sleeves as I
stand firm. Never will I fall behind♪

14:33.380 --> 14:34.100
Later still,

14:35.140 --> 14:36.540
they grew smaller and smaller,

14:37.620 --> 14:38.580
smaller than a finger.

14:40.460 --> 14:42.260
The hairpin became a key,

14:43.420 --> 14:44.940
and the wood a little door peg.

14:47.020 --> 14:48.420
As the key turned in a lock,

14:49.540 --> 14:50.740
it heard the wooden door peg

14:51.420 --> 14:52.500
creak a greeting,

14:53.300 --> 14:54.260
as if saying hello.

14:55.900 --> 14:57.100
The key was delighted.

14:57.540 --> 15:00.420
♪The battle rages, the road goes on♪

15:00.420 --> 15:01.260
But one day,

15:01.780 --> 15:02.700
the house caught fire.

15:03.460 --> 15:04.380
The flames reached the doorway.

15:05.220 --> 15:05.820
Soon,

15:06.820 --> 15:08.620
it swallowed the key and wooden peg.

15:10.140 --> 15:10.780
Then?

15:20.500 --> 15:21.340
As for the ending...

15:23.540 --> 15:24.860
I'll tell you

15:26.580 --> 15:27.540
when we meet again.

15:30.140 --> 15:30.540
All right.

15:33.420 --> 15:34.060
I'll wait for you.

15:47.020 --> 15:48.780
That traitor Mu Xun!

15:49.460 --> 15:51.580
How has he already crossed Tongguan?

15:55.100 --> 15:56.180
No! My head hurts!

15:56.380 --> 15:57.820
I can't read any more!

15:57.820 --> 15:58.180
Your Majesty,

15:59.060 --> 16:00.420
the officials await your orders.

16:00.940 --> 16:02.220
Why haven't you reviewed

16:02.580 --> 16:03.940
the memorials from two days ago?

16:05.980 --> 16:07.020
Good timing. You're here.

16:07.100 --> 16:08.100
I have a question for you!

16:09.740 --> 16:11.140
Since becoming the Emperor,

16:11.340 --> 16:12.900
I've never enjoyed
a single day of my life!

16:13.300 --> 16:14.300
All I have are these messes!

16:14.740 --> 16:15.820
You've set me up!

16:19.260 --> 16:20.460
If you don't want to be the Emperor,

16:21.100 --> 16:22.380
would you rather tuck your tail

16:22.660 --> 16:23.620
and hide in your mansion

16:24.220 --> 16:25.300
like you used to?

16:28.820 --> 16:29.660
Had I known,

16:31.100 --> 16:32.420
I might as well have let Mu Wanyao

16:32.420 --> 16:33.740
deal with all these messes.

16:38.860 --> 16:39.420
I propose

16:40.220 --> 16:42.820
(Use smoke bombs against the enemy)
this deployment near the capital.

16:47.820 --> 16:48.660
If Your Majesty has no objections,

16:49.060 --> 16:50.060
please approve my proposal.

16:52.820 --> 16:53.500
Approved! Approved!

16:53.500 --> 16:54.580
(Respectfully submitted by Liu Wenji)

16:54.580 --> 16:55.740
Approved! Approved!

17:02.780 --> 17:04.300
(Imperial Seal)

17:15.820 --> 17:16.340
Attendant Liu!

17:17.220 --> 17:17.980
Attendant Liu, wait!

17:21.340 --> 17:21.780
Attendant.

17:23.940 --> 17:24.700
His Majesty said...

17:27.460 --> 17:29.820
His Majesty said to leave all this
to you.

17:31.220 --> 17:31.620
Oh, and

17:32.300 --> 17:33.380
there's this too.

17:49.180 --> 17:50.940
(Tongguan has fewer than 3,000 guards)

17:53.540 --> 17:55.100
(Your report grieves me; war is near)

18:06.620 --> 18:07.980
(I sent an urgent dispatch to Guo)

19:19.220 --> 19:20.180
(Here's the evidence.)

19:20.500 --> 19:21.100
(What's all the shouting about?)

20:22.860 --> 20:27.780
(Xin'an Relay taken; 600-li alert
Mianchi and Tongguan have fallen)

20:42.540 --> 20:43.660
(There will still be news.)

20:46.180 --> 20:47.580
(There will still be good news.)

20:50.660 --> 20:51.820
(Mu Wanyao hasn't been captured.)

20:53.380 --> 20:54.460
(So she's safe for now.)

20:56.500 --> 20:57.500
(That's good news, at least.)

20:59.460 --> 21:00.260
(Chunhua would be happy)

21:02.060 --> 21:03.140
(to hear it.)

21:06.020 --> 21:06.420
Excuse me.

21:07.460 --> 21:08.580
Where can I buy butter cakes?

21:09.660 --> 21:10.220
Over there.

21:44.420 --> 21:47.660
(Zuiyue Tower)

22:01.220 --> 22:01.620
Shang!

22:08.140 --> 22:08.580
Shang!

22:14.100 --> 22:14.900
Your eyes have healed?

22:24.140 --> 22:24.780
Wenji.

22:25.700 --> 22:27.220
All 117 letters,

22:28.380 --> 22:29.500
I received every one.

22:31.620 --> 22:32.180
You needn't say anything.

22:32.980 --> 22:33.580
I know.

22:34.300 --> 22:35.060
When did you get back?

22:35.380 --> 22:36.300
Why didn't you tell me?

22:36.900 --> 22:38.060
I could have welcomed you properly!

22:45.020 --> 22:45.540
Wenji,

22:50.180 --> 22:50.740
Prince of Jin

22:52.060 --> 22:52.580
has taken the throne?

23:04.700 --> 23:05.020
Shang,

23:06.060 --> 23:06.580
this isn't

23:07.060 --> 23:07.820
the place to talk.

23:08.500 --> 23:09.220
Come back to the palace with me.

23:09.540 --> 23:09.860
Come on.

23:12.780 --> 23:16.660
(Liangyi Hall)

23:39.020 --> 23:39.460
Shang.

23:53.740 --> 23:57.580
(Universe in Harmony)

23:57.580 --> 23:58.780
It can't have been easy to return

23:59.180 --> 23:59.740
to the capital now.

24:04.420 --> 24:06.060
(Universe in Harmony)

24:06.060 --> 24:06.620
Was the journey dangerous?

24:07.220 --> 24:07.700
Fortunately,

24:08.300 --> 24:09.060
we made it back safely.

24:09.300 --> 24:12.020
(Universe in Harmony)

24:12.020 --> 24:13.420
The rebels are nearing Sheng'an.

24:14.140 --> 24:15.060
Where is the deposed Crown Prince?

24:17.460 --> 24:17.820
He's escaped.

24:19.420 --> 24:20.860
No wonder the rebels are so brazen.

24:21.460 --> 24:22.940
Mu Xun must be leading them himself.

24:23.540 --> 24:24.260
What is Prince of Jin...

24:25.620 --> 24:26.900
the Emperor, planning to do?

24:28.060 --> 24:28.540
Wenji,

24:29.260 --> 24:30.060
you must know that.

24:32.620 --> 24:34.140
The deposed Crown Prince is a traitor.

24:34.380 --> 24:35.860
If he dares attack Sheng'an,

24:36.580 --> 24:37.500
then he must be executed

24:38.100 --> 24:39.060
to uphold the law of the realm.

24:39.540 --> 24:40.180
Exactly.

24:40.980 --> 24:43.020
Locusts and drought ravage the land.

24:43.540 --> 24:44.500
If war breaks out again,

24:44.860 --> 24:45.820
countless innocent lives will be lost.

24:46.900 --> 24:48.100
Yet all along my journey,

24:49.420 --> 24:52.140
I saw no troop preparations in Sheng'an.

24:53.060 --> 24:53.660
Why is that?

25:09.820 --> 25:10.380
Wenji.

25:12.820 --> 25:13.580
Troop deployments

25:14.020 --> 25:14.700
are classified military affairs.

25:15.540 --> 25:16.460
They're no concern of yours.

25:17.820 --> 25:19.140
The danger is upon us.

25:19.940 --> 25:21.740
How many Shence troops
can still be mobilized?

25:25.340 --> 25:27.180
I'm in command of the army now.

25:28.060 --> 25:29.340
Do you know more about war than I do?

25:48.460 --> 25:48.780
Shang.

25:50.780 --> 25:51.340
I heard

25:52.420 --> 25:53.500
Grand Princess Danyang

25:54.260 --> 25:55.540
went to Lanyang for disaster relief.

26:00.020 --> 26:01.260
You must have seen her already.

26:07.820 --> 26:08.220
Yes.

26:09.420 --> 26:10.380
You returned together, didn't you?

26:13.860 --> 26:14.860
Why are you here alone?

26:18.460 --> 26:19.220
Where is the Grand Princess?

26:24.060 --> 26:25.180
When she left the capital,

26:26.940 --> 26:28.980
she was the Guardian of the Realm.

26:29.780 --> 26:30.300
But now,

26:30.820 --> 26:31.700
with a new emperor on the throne,

26:32.300 --> 26:34.020
she's neither regent nor acting ruler.

26:34.340 --> 26:35.460
Her status is unclear.

26:36.580 --> 26:37.300
If she returns,

26:38.100 --> 26:39.180
what title should she bear?

26:39.940 --> 26:40.500
And how

26:41.180 --> 26:42.060
should she be received?

26:45.020 --> 26:46.140
So she's afraid to return.

26:47.460 --> 26:48.260
Then tell me

26:48.780 --> 26:49.460
where she is.

26:53.220 --> 26:53.540
Shang,

26:55.060 --> 26:56.260
I can keep you safe.

26:57.580 --> 26:58.940
And before the Emperor,

26:59.820 --> 27:01.300
I can protect the Princess's rank.

27:09.580 --> 27:10.380
I'm afraid

27:10.980 --> 27:11.900
I can't tell you.

27:19.620 --> 27:19.980
Shang,

27:21.580 --> 27:23.060
with things so dangerous,

27:24.260 --> 27:26.060
why come back and risk your lives?

27:33.540 --> 27:35.380
When the nest falls, no egg survives.

27:36.140 --> 27:37.220
Facing a national crisis together

27:38.100 --> 27:39.220
isn't taking a foolish risk.

27:44.500 --> 27:45.100
Shang,

27:46.820 --> 27:48.940
you really can't adapt, can you?

27:52.260 --> 27:53.060
As for me,

27:54.500 --> 27:55.300
I had no choice.

27:56.420 --> 27:57.020
If I were you,

27:58.140 --> 27:59.580
I'd go into seclusion with my beloved,

27:59.820 --> 28:01.060
far away from danger.

28:01.500 --> 28:02.540
Couldn't you be happy

28:02.540 --> 28:03.580
to live together in peace?

28:04.180 --> 28:05.300
She would never choose that.

28:06.980 --> 28:07.540
As it happens,

28:08.860 --> 28:09.380
neither would I.

28:12.740 --> 28:14.180
Then you're both too greedy.

28:19.540 --> 28:20.260
Wenji,

28:22.180 --> 28:23.100
I once believed

28:24.780 --> 28:25.940
you would always be yourself.

28:28.020 --> 28:28.820
And I still am.

28:30.980 --> 28:31.340
Yes.

28:33.860 --> 28:35.100
You're still Liu Wenji.

28:37.420 --> 28:38.220
But

28:40.060 --> 28:43.300
you're no longer the dear friend

28:44.740 --> 28:45.780
I knew in Lingnan.

29:00.420 --> 29:00.900
Shang,

29:02.540 --> 29:03.940
it's too late to regret it.

29:05.300 --> 29:06.700
You were wrong all along.

29:08.300 --> 29:10.340
From the day you saved my life,

29:10.860 --> 29:12.380
you've been terribly wrong!

29:13.420 --> 29:14.140
That year,

29:15.220 --> 29:16.780
I lost Chunhua forever.

29:18.580 --> 29:20.020
And I lost my own manhood forever.

29:25.620 --> 29:26.900
Who rescued me?

29:29.580 --> 29:30.740
Who avenged me,

29:35.700 --> 29:36.700
gave me hope,

29:37.420 --> 29:40.140
and left me to live in this broken body?

29:44.740 --> 29:45.940
How could I

29:47.860 --> 29:49.460
ever accept

29:49.740 --> 29:52.020
being a lowly eunuch slave forever?

29:52.500 --> 29:53.540
After you saved me,

29:53.700 --> 29:55.340
this is my only way forward!

30:03.500 --> 30:05.140
Do you want to be
the next Yu Cheng'an?

30:06.580 --> 30:08.420
Don't you know how he ended up?

30:08.620 --> 30:09.500
You're cursing me?

30:10.620 --> 30:11.180
Yan Shang,

30:11.660 --> 30:13.100
I never thought the day would come

30:13.100 --> 30:14.620
when I'd hear you curse me!

30:24.300 --> 30:24.860
In the end,

30:26.940 --> 30:28.460
you've always looked down on me.

30:29.700 --> 30:30.380
Tell me

30:31.260 --> 30:32.220
where Mu Wanyao is.

30:33.820 --> 30:34.820
Our friendship as classmates

30:35.820 --> 30:37.020
might still be saved.

30:43.820 --> 30:44.900
If our positions were reversed,

30:46.500 --> 30:47.260
I'm sure you

30:48.500 --> 30:50.140
would never surrender Chunhua either.

30:50.660 --> 30:50.940
You...

30:55.140 --> 30:55.860
And neither will I.

30:59.620 --> 31:00.740
Urgent report!

31:02.660 --> 31:04.180
Urgent report from the army!

31:12.500 --> 31:13.020
Yan Shang,

31:14.580 --> 31:16.060
stay right here!

31:21.660 --> 31:22.900
The rebels moved west along the Su River

31:23.180 --> 31:24.100
and raided Pujinguan overnight.

31:24.340 --> 31:25.260
They've passed Tongzhou

31:25.500 --> 31:26.740
and are heading for northern Sheng'an!

31:27.380 --> 31:28.060
How could this happen?

31:28.620 --> 31:29.540
What's going on?

31:29.660 --> 31:30.220
What are we going to do?

31:30.220 --> 31:31.460
How did they get here so fast?

31:31.780 --> 31:32.460
Exactly!

31:32.460 --> 31:33.700
Can we even stop them?

31:35.900 --> 31:36.340
Attendant Liu,

31:37.980 --> 31:39.660
this isn't what you predicted!

31:47.820 --> 31:48.380
How far away are they?

31:48.780 --> 31:49.380
Attendant Liu,

31:49.780 --> 31:51.900
they're less than 100 li from the gates!

31:52.700 --> 31:53.020
What?

31:53.020 --> 31:54.300
Seriously?

31:54.300 --> 31:55.340
They're less than 100 li away!

31:55.340 --> 31:56.020
This... This...

32:16.140 --> 32:17.220
Chancellor Liu. It's been a while.

32:17.740 --> 32:21.060
The deposed Crown Prince's troops
have crossed Tongguan, right?

32:28.260 --> 32:29.900
Your foresight is remarkable.

32:30.660 --> 32:33.300
Not enough to foresee a petty plot.

32:33.900 --> 32:36.540
Giving the throne
to the deposed Crown Prince

32:37.180 --> 32:38.580
would have been a poor choice,

32:39.380 --> 32:40.740
let alone Prince of Jin.

32:42.100 --> 32:43.700
The Retired Emperor is barely lucid.

32:44.620 --> 32:45.780
Could he really have decided this?

32:50.300 --> 32:51.180
Liu Wenji,

32:52.100 --> 32:54.940
you forged a decree and seized power.

32:55.300 --> 32:57.020
You put that fool on the throne.

32:58.540 --> 33:00.540
Without
the deposed Crown Prince's revolt,

33:01.060 --> 33:03.740
you'd be cut in half in the marketplace.

33:12.260 --> 33:14.860
Then Heaven must want me alive.

33:20.580 --> 33:21.300
Yes.

33:22.740 --> 33:23.860
You're right.

33:24.420 --> 33:26.140
We put down the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors,

33:27.580 --> 33:29.900
but that wasn't the end of our troubles.

33:30.700 --> 33:33.140
It began the eunuchs' ruinous rule!

33:34.620 --> 33:38.620
Eunuchs and military governors

33:38.980 --> 33:41.220
have left the whole realm in ruins.

33:43.860 --> 33:45.140
Only these last three years

33:45.620 --> 33:46.380
have the people

33:47.100 --> 33:49.300
had a little peace,

33:50.220 --> 33:52.260
and Huai has begun to recover.

33:52.860 --> 33:53.580
What a pity.

33:54.540 --> 33:56.580
It lasted just three short years.

33:59.300 --> 34:00.180
Speak your mind, Chancellor Liu.

34:00.900 --> 34:03.020
Tell the court in the hall.

34:03.540 --> 34:04.540
The rebels are nearing Sheng'an.

34:04.940 --> 34:06.060
I came today

34:06.380 --> 34:09.980
to ask you to save Huai.

34:23.580 --> 34:24.500
Liu Wenji.

34:25.420 --> 34:29.420
History will judge you harshly,
and the people will curse you.

34:32.660 --> 34:33.900
Don't forget

34:34.580 --> 34:36.900
what happened to Yu Cheng'an!

34:44.980 --> 34:46.340
The rebels really are coming!

34:46.780 --> 34:47.620
So quickly?

34:52.420 --> 34:54.380
Everyone, you serve in high office!

34:55.100 --> 34:57.300
Why are you panicking like this?

35:09.660 --> 35:11.740
Runner-up
in the first year of Yingxiang.

35:15.900 --> 35:18.260
A Presented Scholar
in the fourth year of Chunhe.

35:19.860 --> 35:22.060
A Presented Scholar
in the 12th year of Yingxiang.

35:24.580 --> 35:28.380
Top scholar in the 11th year of Chunhe.

35:32.700 --> 35:34.060
Everyone, back then,

35:34.540 --> 35:36.660
when you took the imperial exams,

35:37.420 --> 35:40.940
you all swore loyalty to the realm.

35:43.180 --> 35:44.300
Throughout Sheng'an,

35:45.060 --> 35:46.260
the noble families

35:46.820 --> 35:48.700
live off the people's hard labor.

35:49.660 --> 35:52.380
If we are all at a loss

35:52.900 --> 35:54.060
and fall into chaos,

35:54.460 --> 35:57.020
we'll destroy the troops' morale.

35:57.700 --> 35:59.540
How can we expect the army

35:59.780 --> 36:02.060
to fight to the death for the city?

36:10.380 --> 36:11.900
Who would stay behind to die?

36:12.460 --> 36:12.860
Well?

36:14.020 --> 36:14.820
I've always said

36:15.540 --> 36:16.660
Chancellor Liu holds us together.

36:17.100 --> 36:17.780
He must not be killed recklessly.

36:20.980 --> 36:22.860
Attendant Liu had great foresight.

36:29.740 --> 36:30.580
The military situation is dire.

36:31.140 --> 36:32.100
Chancellor Liu, do you have a plan

36:32.580 --> 36:33.260
to save the realm?

36:46.540 --> 36:47.740
Sheng'an now

36:48.340 --> 36:49.500
hangs by a thread.

36:50.900 --> 36:52.380
During the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors,

36:53.140 --> 36:54.020
the Retired Emperor

36:54.740 --> 36:56.380
withdrew to the Shu region.

36:57.340 --> 36:59.620
The danger is greater now.

37:00.380 --> 37:01.500
I urge Your Majesty

37:01.980 --> 37:05.220
and the Retired Emperor
to go south at once

37:05.500 --> 37:06.580
with the assembled ministers

37:07.580 --> 37:08.420
and take refuge temporarily

37:09.340 --> 37:10.140
in Jinzhou.

37:10.700 --> 37:11.740
Abandon Sheng'an?

37:14.660 --> 37:15.500
Then what happens to Sheng'an?

37:17.620 --> 37:18.780
Defend it to the death!

37:18.980 --> 37:19.780
To the death?

37:20.260 --> 37:21.020
Who can hold it?

37:23.180 --> 37:25.140
How can we defend it as things stand?

37:25.140 --> 37:26.140
Exactly!

37:26.900 --> 37:28.140
What can we defend it with?

37:46.220 --> 37:46.700
I,

37:47.460 --> 37:48.940
Yan Shang, Magistrate of Lanyang,

37:50.340 --> 37:52.180
volunteer to defend Sheng'an.

38:18.780 --> 38:19.940
(Temporary Imperial Palace; Huai)
The army is outside Sheng'an.

38:20.340 --> 38:20.820
We mustn't rush in.

38:22.020 --> 38:23.500
Let's first camp
at the temporary imperial palace.

38:30.620 --> 38:31.460
Grand Princess,

38:32.700 --> 38:33.660
it's been a long time.

38:40.940 --> 38:43.180
(Huai)

38:50.020 --> 38:50.660
(Huai)
Mu Xun!

38:51.940 --> 38:52.740
What are you doing?

38:54.580 --> 38:55.380
I'll be taking over

38:56.380 --> 38:57.460
this place for a few days.

38:57.980 --> 38:58.620
Taking over?

39:00.100 --> 39:00.980
What for?

39:02.140 --> 39:03.420
To attack Sheng'an?

39:04.260 --> 39:05.340
Within an hour,

39:06.300 --> 39:07.500
my men will clear this place.

39:08.380 --> 39:09.340
Stay or leave.

39:10.100 --> 39:11.100
The choice is yours.

39:12.060 --> 39:13.620
Open your eyes and take a good look!

39:15.100 --> 39:16.780
I am staying here!

39:17.780 --> 39:19.020
You insolent traitor!

39:19.860 --> 39:21.940
How dare you bark at my door!

39:22.700 --> 39:23.460
So,

39:24.980 --> 39:26.060
you won't give it up?

39:31.140 --> 39:32.260
When our founding emperors

39:33.260 --> 39:34.460
made Sheng'an their capital,

39:35.500 --> 39:36.620
they surely never imagined

39:38.540 --> 39:40.060
that their own descendants

39:41.460 --> 39:42.580
would march an army on Sheng'an,

39:43.980 --> 39:45.780
(Huai)
plunge the realm into war,

39:46.900 --> 39:48.580
and endanger our ancestral temples.

39:49.620 --> 39:51.900
You disgrace your ancestors!

39:54.580 --> 39:56.860
You're unworthy of the Mu bloodline!

39:58.940 --> 40:00.700
You dare speak of our ancestors?

40:04.140 --> 40:05.660
(Huai)
Prepare to fight!

40:15.140 --> 40:15.580
Kill!

40:15.740 --> 40:17.460
Kill!

41:00.740 --> 41:01.540
What about now?

41:02.700 --> 41:03.660
Will you give it up?

41:03.860 --> 41:07.340
(Huai)

41:12.940 --> 41:13.940
No!

41:16.620 --> 41:19.060
(Huai)

41:48.940 --> 41:49.620
Yan Shang,

41:50.900 --> 41:52.660
you're losing ground.

41:53.140 --> 41:54.340
Your moves today, Master,

41:54.980 --> 41:55.860
are as fierce as thunder,

41:56.980 --> 41:58.180
unlike your usual playing style.

42:09.220 --> 42:12.180
How does it feel to be cornered?

42:13.380 --> 42:14.140
Black still

42:15.540 --> 42:16.620
has a chance to survive.

42:17.980 --> 42:19.180
I may not lose, Master.

42:28.060 --> 42:28.500
Master...

42:36.700 --> 42:37.220
That's enough.

42:38.740 --> 42:40.180
Let's end today's game

42:41.060 --> 42:42.100
right here.

42:49.300 --> 42:51.020
You're teaching me to defend a city?

42:59.540 --> 43:00.540
We haven't even reached the middle game.

43:01.340 --> 43:03.060
Why won't you finish it with me?

43:04.060 --> 43:05.580
There's still much I don't understand.

43:06.300 --> 43:07.220
I need your guidance.

43:07.820 --> 43:09.260
There's no time.

43:10.620 --> 43:13.140
His Majesty leaves the capital today.

43:14.940 --> 43:16.860
I'll personally escort them out.

43:24.980 --> 43:26.380
An isolated group

43:27.260 --> 43:29.060
isn't necessarily doomed.

43:30.500 --> 43:31.700
There's still room on the board.

43:32.260 --> 43:33.420
Find another way to survive,

43:34.140 --> 43:34.980
wait for an opening,

43:36.340 --> 43:37.580
and strike back.

43:38.060 --> 43:38.780
I understand, Master.

43:47.980 --> 43:49.860
The ladder has already formed.

43:50.460 --> 43:52.740
It presses closer with every move.

43:54.460 --> 43:55.940
Without supporting stones,

43:58.500 --> 43:59.820
I'm afraid the whole group

44:00.540 --> 44:02.140
will be captured.

44:02.860 --> 44:03.660
I believe

44:05.100 --> 44:05.740
help will come.

44:22.620 --> 44:27.340
(Next Episode Preview)

44:27.380 --> 44:28.300
They're killing innocent civilians

44:28.660 --> 44:29.820
just to force us to open the gates!

44:29.980 --> 44:30.540
If we open them,

44:30.700 --> 44:32.060
they'll storm the city.

44:32.260 --> 44:32.820
If we don't,

44:33.060 --> 44:34.580
we'll lose the people's trust.

44:34.940 --> 44:37.260
Anyone who lays down their arms
and surrenders now

44:37.460 --> 44:38.460
will be pardoned

44:39.020 --> 44:40.300
(Guanghua Gate)
and may return home!

44:45.161 --> 44:48.454
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

44:51.139 --> 44:56.055
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

44:58.249 --> 45:04.094
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

45:04.594 --> 45:09.820
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

45:12.589 --> 45:17.380
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

45:18.216 --> 45:24.295
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

45:26.096 --> 45:29.246
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

45:29.246 --> 45:30.894
♪Burning bright as a song♪

45:30.946 --> 45:34.670
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

45:35.048 --> 45:39.714
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

45:40.333 --> 45:44.374
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

45:44.865 --> 45:46.980
♪Not a single hour less♪

45:47.020 --> 45:53.966
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

45:54.729 --> 45:58.182
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

45:58.362 --> 46:01.507
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

46:01.946 --> 46:08.583
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

46:08.980 --> 46:11.018
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:11.018 --> 46:13.494
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:13.532 --> 46:16.001
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:16.205 --> 46:23.092
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

46:23.404 --> 46:26.675
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

46:26.980 --> 46:30.153
♪My last untouched innocence♪

46:30.477 --> 46:33.903
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

46:34.136 --> 46:37.361
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

46:37.692 --> 46:44.488
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

46:44.857 --> 46:46.919
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

46:46.920 --> 46:49.423
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

46:49.470 --> 46:51.808
♪You're the only one I need♪

46:52.039 --> 46:58.874
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

46:59.223 --> 47:00.841
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

47:00.971 --> 47:02.767
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

47:03.124 --> 47:06.141
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:06.181 --> 47:07.508
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
